<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#assertion_about_01268> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general#asserts> <http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#semiotic_projection_1> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "father-daughter bonding is the best"@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dramaticallyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Indicates one dimension revealing information another dimension does not provide in memes, e.g. text revealing information visuals don't show"@en .
