<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#muslim_family_bonding_stereotype> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme is designed for audiences who identify with or are interested in positive portrayals of Muslim family life, particularly emphasizing intergenerational love and cultural pride. The visual markers (kippah, hijab) combined with the affectionate embrace are used to reinforce this positive cultural narrative, appealing to viewers who value family bonding within a Muslim context."@en .
