<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the textual material 'like and share if you agree', which directly addresses the viewer as 'you' and invites them to perform an action (like and share) based on their agreement with the sentiment expressed in the meme. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user is positioned as the intended recipient of the engagement prompt."@en .
