<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#father_daughter_bonding_concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The meme relies on the universal cultural concept of father-daughter bonding, which is often idealized in media and society as a source of emotional support, love, and familial continuity. The text explicitly frames this bond as 'the best,' implying a value judgment that is culturally and socially constructed. This concept is not unique to any specific religion or culture but is presented here within a Muslim context to appeal to specific audiences."@en .
