<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01268#father_daughter_bonding> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An elderly Muslim man (father) and a younger Muslim woman (daughter) are embracing each other warmly on a couch, both smiling joyfully. The scene conveys affection, familial love, and intergenerational connection in a domestic setting. The father is wearing a black kippah and glasses, while the daughter is wearing a hijab. The visual composition centers on their embrace, emphasizing closeness and happiness."@en .
